@startuml sequence_target
title Sequence — Асинхронная событийная цепочка обработки в целевой платформе (To-Be)

autonumber
actor "B2B Заявитель" as client
participant "Envoy Ingress Gateway" as envoy
queue "Kafka Event Bus\n(Topics)" as kafka
participant "STT Service\n(Yandex SpeechKit)" as stt
participant "AI Perception Service\n(Python LangGraph)" as ai_service
database "PostgreSQL 18\n(pgvector)" as postgres
participant "Core Decision Engine\n(Go / Temporal.io)" as temporal
participant "React HITL Console\n(Operator UI)" as ui
participant "1C Enterprise Adapter" as adapter_1c
participant "1С:ERP Server" as erp
participant "Arize AI / OTel" as arize

client -> envoy: Входящий звонок / Telegram / Email / REST
envoy -> kafka: Publish Event `InboundMessageReceived` (Topic: events.inbound.raw)

alt Канал: Голосовой звонок (SIP / RTP)
    kafka -> stt: Consume Event `InboundMessageReceived`
    stt -> stt: Потоковое распознавание речи и диаризация
    stt -> kafka: Publish Event `SpeechTranscribed` (Topic: events.inbound.text)
end

kafka -> ai_service: Consume Event `events.inbound.text`

group 1. AI Perception & RAG Phase (Python LangGraph)
    ai_service -> postgres: Vector Search: Поиск гибридных аналогов инцидентов (pgvector)
    postgres --> ai_service: Топ-3 похожих оборудования и объектов
    ai_service -> ai_service: Вызов LLM (gpt-4o / Qwen) c JSON Schema
    ai_service -> ai_service: Pydantic Validation & Guardrail Filter
    ai_service -> kafka: Publish Event `FactsExtracted` (Topic: events.facts.extracted)
    ai_service -> arize: Export OTel Span (Token Cost, Latency, Prompt Metrics)
end

group 2. Temporal State Machine Phase (Go Workers)
    kafka -> temporal: Consume Event `FactsExtracted`
    temporal -> temporal: Start Workflow `DispatchServiceRequestWorkflow`
    
    temporal -> postgres: Activity: `DBLookupActivity` (Сверка контрагента и договора)
    postgres --> temporal: Site & Contract: Gold Plan (60m SLA, 24x7)
    
    temporal -> postgres: Activity: `AssetDisambiguationActivity` (TC-02 Check)
    postgres --> temporal: Found Open Ticket T-884
    
    temporal -> temporal: Activity: `BusinessHoursSLACalculator` (Дедлайн: +60m)
    
    alt Confidence < 0.85 OR Repeat Alert (TC-02)
        temporal -> ui: WebSocket Event: `TicketWaitingHITL` (Пауза Workflow)
        note over temporal, ui: Temporal Workflow находится в состоянии ожидания Signal (HITL)
        ui -> envoy: Оператор нажимает "Утвердить и отправить в 1С"
        envoy -> temporal: Send Signal `ApproveTicketSignal`
    end
end

group 3. 1C Enterprise Integration Phase
    temporal -> adapter_1c: Activity: `CommitTo1CActivity`
    adapter_1c -> erp: POST /1c/odata/v2/Document_ЗаявкаНаРемонт
    erp --> adapter_1c: 201 Created (Ref_Key: "ЗР-00042")
    adapter_1c --> temporal: Commit Success
    
    temporal -> postgres: Update Ticket Status -> IN_PROGRESS
    temporal -> kafka: Publish Event `TicketDispatchedTo1C`
    
    temporal -> client: Telegram Notification: "Ваша заявка №ЗР-00042 зарегистрирована..."
end

@endl
